      "text": "The zombie dragon breathes a wave of fetid viscera that deals 5d6 bludgeoning damage and 5d6 poison damage (DC 28 basic Reflex save save). A creature that critically fails is also Sickened 2. The zombie dragon can't use Viscera Breath again for 1d4 rounds."
